  "description": "The languid but knowledgeable Librarian of the Knights of Favonius who was deemed by Sumeru Academia to be their most distinguished graduate in the past two centuries.",
  "skillTalents": [
    {
      "name": "Lightning Touch",
      "unlock": "Normal Attack",
      "description": "Normal Attack\nPerform up to 4 lightning attacks that deal Electro DMG.\nCharged Attack\nConsumes a certain amount of Stamina to deal AoE Electro DMG after a short casting time.\nPlunging Attack\nGathering the might of Electro, Lisa plunges towards the ground from mid-air, damaging all enemies in her path. Deals AoE Electro DMG upon impact with the ground.",
      "upgrades": [
